{"synopsis":"Aku adalah anjing yang dirantai di kehidupan sebelumnya\nAku tidak ingat siapa orang tuaku dan menjalani hidup tanpa perasaan\nseperti sebuah alatHidupku diakhiri oleh masterku yang membunuhku secara kejam\nKukira itu adalah akhir kehidupanku Tapi ketika aku membuka mata\nAku terlahir sebagai anak yang paling muda dari keluarga terkuat di benua\nUntuk membalas dendam dan melindungi mereka yang menyayangiku di kehidupan baruku ini\nAku memilih untuk menggunakan pedang alihalih menggunakan belati","alternative_title":"환생한 암살자는 검술 천재","author":"Daon Studio, Gulant","artist":"Tess (테스)","chapters":[{"number":"95","chapter":"95","slug":"ch_95","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"5863ba8e-94b3-4edb-9e39-a96af08923e9","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30"},{"chapter_id":"5b653fe3-9519-40a8-81f9-f9d60dc8a473","number":"93","chapter":"93","title":"","date":"2026-07-23","released":"2026-07-23"},{"chapter_id":"1b42789f-8ea2-4ab5-ae1e-ca8865a7c7eb","number":"92","chapter":"92","title":"","date":"2026-07-09","released":"2026-07-09"},{"chapter_id":"1545a0fc-1ce3-4246-858a-8e30a769e9f5","number":"91","chapter":"91","title":"","date":"2026-07-02","released":"2026-07-02"},{"chapter_id":"1cf6d6bf-fd78-4898-9641-c46a138412b9","number":"90","chapter":"90","title":"","date":"2026-06-25","released":"2026-06-25"},{"chapter_id":"20c3a1a6-5961-48cc-82ef-df422e395a49","number":"89","chapter":"89","title":"","date":"2026-06-18","released":"2026-06-18"},{"chapter_id":"16ff9ddb-f6ad-432f-81d3-6d511e234746","number":"88","chapter":"88","title":"","date":"2026-06-04","released":"2026-06-04"},{"chapter_id":"2b473bff-098a-4bbb-8a55-24928666f4d1","number":"87","chapter":"87","title":"","date":"2026-05-28","released":"2026-05-28"},{"chapter_id":"ae13e8f9-3165-43e4-b65f-64e4176bb471","number":"86","chapter":"86","title":"","date":"2026-05-21","released":"2026-05-21"},{"chapter_id":"43f6a257-6e64-4be2-86e5-